'''Kephri's Phantom''' is a monster encountered in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. It is summoned alongside [[Akkha's Phantom]] by [[Elidinis' Warden]] in the third phase of the final battle.

As a phantom of [[Kephri]], it will use its standard fireball attack to attack the player. If the Aerial Assault invocation is enabled, the fireball will do more damage and hit in a 3x3 area of effect instead.

